WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.058
Unit seven. Drink More Water!

2
00:00:04.007 --> 00:00:07.643
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.693 --> 00:00:11.079
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.129 --> 00:00:14.874
Today we learn about Drink More Water. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.878 --> 00:00:19.211
Water. Say it with me. Water!

6
00:00:22.708 --> 00:00:26.291
Thirsty. Say it with me. Thirsty!

7
00:00:29.811 --> 00:00:32.994
Bottle. Say it with me. Bottle!

8
00:00:36.473 --> 00:00:40.506
Sugary drink. Say it with me. Sugary drink!

9
00:00:44.005 --> 00:00:47.639
Healthy. Say it with me. Healthy!

10
00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:54.906
Energy. Say it with me. Energy!

11
00:00:58.422 --> 00:01:02.122
Hot day. Say it with me. Hot day!

12
00:01:05.624 --> 00:01:08.707
Sip. Say it with me. Sip!

13
00:01:12.217 --> 00:01:21.338
Water is the best drink for my body. On a hot day, I sip water from my bottle even before I feel thirsty. A sugary drink is not as healthy as water.

14
00:01:21.388 --> 00:01:22.624
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.828 --> 00:01:28.928
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.978 --> 00:01:30.128
Bottle!

17
00:01:31.031 --> 00:01:36.229
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.279 --> 00:01:37.429
Hot day!

19
00:01:38.321 --> 00:01:42.797
Did you know? Feeling thirsty is your body's way of asking for water!

20
00:01:42.847 --> 00:01:44.980
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.429 --> 00:01:54.230
Think and answer. When do you drink water during the day?

22
00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.430
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.702 --> 00:02:01.563
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.613 --> 00:02:04.309
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

